From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes Studio Local Patches <local-patches@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 14:39:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(coding-agents): forward provider headers to upstream
 requests

resolveStoredProviderLaunchInput reads extra_headers and
preserve_client_identity from the selected custom provider on every
launch (a complete runtime triple no longer short-circuits the config
read) and threads them onto the registered proxy target. The
claude-code and codex proxies then append the configured headers, plus
the inbound CLI identity headers when preserve_client_identity is on,
to every upstream request.
